# These were tracked in Git LFS and are not any more, deliberately.
#
# GitHub serves LFS files as POINTER STUBS in the "Download ZIP" archive, and to any clone made
# without git-lfs installed. The four binaries here total 5.8 MB — the rig, its pre-optimisation
# original, and the Blender scene with its glTF export — so LFS was buying nothing, while
# guaranteeing that the most common way of getting this repository delivers a 130-byte text file
# where the character rig should be. The playable would then fall back to the painted placeholder
# with no error, which is the worst kind of failure: silent, and on the thing the project is about.
#
# Keep it that way. Anything genuinely large enough to need LFS does not belong in this repo.

# Treat the binaries as binary, so git never tries to diff or line-ending-convert them.
*.blend binary
*.glb   binary
*.fbx   binary
*.psd   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.webp  binary
